ponent had. Lower is better."},{"key":"xg_diff","label":"xG difference","fmt":"2","lower":false,"group":"Results","desc":"xG for minus xG against per match: the underlying margin between a team and its opponents. Higher is better."},{"key":"goals_for","label":"Goals for","fmt":"2","lower":false,"group":"Attack","desc":"Goals scored per match."},{"key":"goals_against","label":"Goals against","fmt":"2","lower":true,"group":"Defence","desc":"Goals conceded per match. Lower is better."},{"key":"finishing","label":"Finishing","fmt":"2","lower":false,"group":"Attack","desc":"Goals scored minus expected goals, per match: positive means the team has scored more than its chances were worth."},{"key":"keeping","label":"Keeping","fmt":"2","lower":false,"group":"Defence","desc":"Expected goals against minus goals conceded, per match: positive means the team has conceded less than the chances it allowed were worth. Higher is better."},{"key":"xpts_per_match","label":"xPts per match","fmt":"2","lower":false,"group":"Results","desc":"Expected points per match: for each match, the points a team would earn on average if its xG and its opponent's xG were replayed as Poisson goal counts. Higher is better."},{"key":"luck","label":"Luck","fmt":"2","lower":false,"group":"Results","desc":"Points minus expected points, per match: how far results have run ahead of (positive) or behind (negative) the underlying performance."},{"key":"possession","label":"Possession","fmt":"pct","lower":false,"group":"Style","desc":"Share of the ball, averaged over matches, as a percentage."},{"key":"field_tilt","label":"Field tilt","fmt":"pct","lower":false,"group":"Style","desc":"Touches in the opponent's box as a percentage of touches in both boxes (own box touches divided by own plus opponent box touches). Above 50 means the team spends more of the game in the dangerous end than its opponents do."},{"key":"ppda","label":"PPDA","fmt":"1","lower":true,"group":"Style","desc":"Passes per defensive action: the opponent's passes divided by the team's tackles, interceptions and fouls. A low number means the team presses (it lets the opponent make few passes before engaging). Lower is better for a pressing side."},{"key":"shots","label":"Shots","fmt":"1","lower":false,"group":"Attack","desc":"Shots attempted per match."},{"key":"shots_against","label":"Shots against","fmt":"1","lower":true,"group":"Defence","desc":"Shots faced per match. Lower is better."},{"key":"shot_quality","label":"Shot quality","fmt":"2","lower":false,"group":"Attack","desc":"xG per shot: the average quality of the chances a team takes. Higher means better chances, not necessarily more."},{"key":"shot_quality_against","label":"Shot quality against","fmt":"2","lower":true,"group":"Defence","desc":"xG per shot faced: the average quality of the chances a team allows. Lower is better."},{"key":"sot_pct","label":"Shots on target %","fmt":"pct","lower":false,"group":"Attack","desc":"Shots on target as a percentage of shots attempted (denominator: shots)."},{"key":"sot_diff","label":"Shots on target difference","fmt":"2","lower":false,"group":"Results","desc":"Shots on target for minus shots on target against, per match: a plain count of who tests the goalkeeper more often. It settles as quickly as xG difference and predicts the points that follow about as well. Higher is better."},{"key":"big_chances","label":"Big chances","fmt":"2","lower":false,"group":"Attack","desc":"Big chances created per match: situations where a goal is expected."},{"key":"big_chances_missed","label":"Big chances missed","fmt":"2","lower":true,"group":"Attack","desc":"Big chances not scored per match. Lower is better."},{"key":"corners","label":"Corners","fmt":"1","lower":false,"group":"Attack","desc":"Corners won per match."},{"key":"aerial_pct","label":"Aerial duels won","fmt":"pct","lower":false,"group":"Defence","desc":"Aerial duels won as a percentage of aerial duels contested (denominator: aerial duels contested)."},{"key":"ground_duel_pct","label":"Ground duels won","fmt":"pct","lower":false,"group":"Defence","desc":"Ground duels won as a percentage of ground duels contested (denominator: ground duels contested)."},{"key":"passes","label":"Passes","fmt":"int","lower":false,"group":"Style","desc":"Passes attempted per match."},{"key":"pass_pct","label":"Pass completion","fmt":"pct","lower":false,"group":"Style","desc":"Successful passes as a percentage of passes attempted (denominator: passes attempted)."},{"key":"long_ball_share","label":"Long-ball share","fmt":"pct","lower":false,"group":"Style","desc":"Long balls attempted as a percentage of passes attempted (denominator: passes attempted): a direct side runs high, a possession side low. Neither is better."},{"key":"crosses","label":"Crosses","fmt":"1","lower":false,"group":"Style","desc":"Crosses attempted per match."},{"key":"dribbles","label":"Dribbles","fmt":"1","lower":false,"group":"Style","desc":"Dribbles completed per match."},{"key":"fouls","label":"Fouls","fmt":"1","lower":true,"group":"Discipline","desc":"Fouls committed per match. Lower is better."},{"key":"cards","label":"Cards","fmt":"2","lower":true,"group":"Discipline","desc":"Card points per match: one for a yellow, two for a red. Lower is better."},{"key":"km","label":"Distance (km)","fmt":"1","lower":false,"group":"Physical","desc":"Kilometres covered by the whole team per match."},{"key":"sprints","label":"Sprints","fmt":"int","lower":false,"group":"Physical","desc":"Sprints by the whole team per match."},{"key":"rating","label":"Rating","fmt":"2","lower":false,"group":"Results","desc":"Sofascore's average 1-10 team rating per match."}],"player_metrics":["rating","ga_90","npxg_xa_90","finishing","placement","xa_per_kp","shot_creation_90","prog_actions_90","padj_tkl_int_90","ball_wins_90","duel_pct","aerial_pct","loss_per_100","pass_pct","km_90","goals_prevented_90","save_pct"]}